# Offline Test Safety

Normal unit, contract, integration, and Quality Gate tests must make zero live calls to:

- Apify
- Alibaba
- Facebook Marketplace
- Mercado Libre
- DeepL
- Azure
- MiniMax
- other external provider APIs

Never use runtime secrets in ordinary pytest.

Live testing must be explicitly separated and opt-in.

Never convert an offline regression into a live test.

Never add retries to live smoke tests unless explicitly authorized.

Live smoke tests must have explicit bounded budgets.

Mocks/fakes must model the external boundary, not bypass the application behavior under test.

Prefer sanitized real-world fixtures for provider payload contracts.
